Z||000001||WKDFIRO||11-28-1999||09:09 PM||||You went from the 5 speed to an Isuzu 4 speed? Is it on a V6 or 4 cyl??? Isuzu 4 speeds don't last long on a V6 especially if you beat it up. Isuzu 5 speeds are stronger cases.<P> The Speedo is located just above where the passenger side drive axle goes into the case.||||reg||1
